sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as 👤 사용자
    participant UI as Next.js UI
    participant API as ClusterController
    participant CS as ClusterService
    participant JS as JobService
    participant MS as MultipassService
    participant MP as Multipass VM

    User->>UI: 클러스터 생성 요청<br/>(name, masterSpec, workerCount)
    UI->>API: POST /api/clusters
    API->>CS: createCluster(req)

    CS->>CS: clusterRepository.existsByName() 중복 확인
    CS->>CS: Cluster(status=CREATING) 저장
    CS->>JS: createJob(CLUSTER_CREATE)
    JS-->>CS: jobId

    CS-->>API: jobId
    API-->>UI: { jobId }

    Note over CS,MP: @Async — 백그라운드 실행

    CS->>JS: start(jobId)
    CS->>MS: launchMaster(name, cpus, mem, disk, image)
    MS->>MP: multipass launch --name {name}-master
    MP-->>MS: 완료
    MS-->>CS: 로그 스트리밍

    CS->>MS: getMasterIp(name)
    MS->>MP: multipass exec {name}-master -- hostname -I
    MP-->>MS: masterIp

    CS->>MS: getNodeToken(name)
    MS->>MP: multipass exec {name}-master -- cat /var/lib/rancher/k3s/server/node-token
    MP-->>MS: nodeToken

    loop workerCount 번 반복
        CS->>MS: launchWorker(name, i, spec, masterIp, nodeToken)
        MS->>MP: multipass launch --name {name}-worker{i}
        MP-->>MS: 완료
    end

    CS->>MS: getKubeconfig(name)
    MS->>MP: multipass exec {name}-master -- cat /etc/rancher/k3s/k3s.yaml
    MP-->>MS: kubeconfig YAML

    CS->>MS: saveKubeconfig(name, kubeconfig)
    CS->>CS: updateClusterStatus(RUNNING)
    CS->>JS: complete(jobId)

    UI->>API: GET /api/jobs/{jobId} (polling)
    API-->>UI: { status: SUCCESS, log: ... }
    UI-->>User: 클러스터 생성 완료
